[24.319287, "o", "# Morning report, Wed Oct 21 2026\r\n\r\n🔴 **The orders_2026-10-24.csv file failed for 63 rows due to currency and quantity violations.**\r\nPrioritize fixing the currency and quantity issues in orders_2026-10-24.csv.\r\n\r\n## Suggested fixes\r\n\r\n- `orders_2026-10-24.csv` · `currency` · *fix_data*: Correct currency values to USD, EUR, or GBP.\r\n- `orders_2026-10-24.csv` · `quantity` · *fix_data*: Ensure quantity values are greater than or equal to 1.\r\n- `orders_2026-10-24.csv` · `customer_id` · *fix_data*: Correct customer IDs to match the pattern 'cus_[0-9]{5}'.\r\n"]
